<article class="grid max-w-5xl gap-6">
    {{ template "hero.gohtml" . }}

<table><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Public methods</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Construction</td><td><code>New(opts...)</code>, <code>NewTranslator(translationsDir, templateDir)</code>, <code>Untranslated(opts...)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Loading</td><td><code>SetLanguage(lang)</code>, <code>SetLanguageFS(lang, fsys, name)</code>, <code>LoadLanguages(sources...)</code>, <code>EnsureLanguage(lang)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Module defaults</td><td><code>MergeDefaults(language, files, name)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Lookups</td><td><code>Tl</code>, <code>Tn</code>, <code>Ctl</code>, <code>Ctn</code>, <code>Lookup</code>, <code>LookupN</code>, <code>LookupC</code>, <code>LookupCN</code></td></tr><tr><td>Template helpers</td><td><code>FuncMap()</code></td></tr><tr><td>Missing translations</td><td><code>SetUntranslated</code>, <code>ShowOriginal</code>, <code>Miss</code></td></tr><tr><td>Language fallback</td><td><code>SetLanguageFallback</code>, <code>LanguageFallback</code></td></tr><tr><td>Extraction</td><td><code>ScanFiles(root)</code>, <code>CheckMissingTranslations()</code>, <code>SetRecordMissing</code>, <code>RecordMissing</code></td></tr><tr><td>Editing</td><td><code>NewLanguage</code>, <code>SetTL</code>, <code>SetTLN</code>, <code>SetCTL</code>, <code>SetCTN</code>, <code>Write</code></td></tr><tr><td>Metadata</td><td><code>Details</code>, <code>SetDetails</code>, <code>AddDetails</code>, <code>SetRefs</code></td></tr><tr><td>Headers and files</td><td><code>GetHeaderForLanguage</code>, <code>DefaultHeader</code>, <code>WritePOTFile(path)</code>, <code>WritePOFile(path, language)</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Configuration</h2>
<p><code>SetTranslationsDir</code>, <code>SetTemplateDir</code>, <code>SetPotFile</code> and <code>SetPrefixSeparator</code> have matching getters. The defaults are the variables <code>DefaultPotFile</code> (<code>translations.pot</code>), <code>DefaultPoExtension</code> (<code>.po</code>), <code>TemplateExtension</code> (<code>.gohtml</code>, the files that extraction scans) and <code>DefaultSeparator</code> (<code>__.</code>, the prefix separator). Apply setters before extraction or concurrent lookups. A translator made with <code>New</code> has no template directory; call <code>SetTemplateDir</code> before <code>CheckMissingTranslations</code>. The markers for missing translations are the variables <code>DefaultNoTranslationTL</code>, <code>DefaultNoTranslationTN</code>, <code>DefaultNoTranslationCTL</code> and <code>DefaultNoTranslationCTN</code>. <code>WritePOTFile</code> and <code>WritePOFile</code> create an empty POT or PO file with a header when it does not exist. After editing <code>plurals.json</code>, regenerate the plural rules with <code>go run tools/generate_templates.go</code> in the repository.</p>
<h2>Options</h2>
<p><code>New</code> and <code>Untranslated</code> take options. Each option does what the setter of the same name does.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Setter</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>WithTranslationsDir(dir)</code></td><td><code>SetTranslationsDir</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>WithUntranslated(fn)</code></td><td><code>SetUntranslated</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>WithLanguageFallback(bool)</code></td><td><code>SetLanguageFallback</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><code>New</code> differs from <code>NewTranslator</code> in one default: it records nothing while translating unless you call <code>SetRecordMissing(true)</code>. <code>Untranslated</code> is <code>New</code> with <code>WithUntranslated(ShowOriginal)</code> first, and returns a new translator on every call.</p>
<h2>The extract package</h2>
<p><code>github.com/donseba/go-translator/v2/extract</code> has <code>Extract</code>, <code>Files</code>, <code>Source</code>, <code>Extractor</code>, <code>Function</code> and <code>DefaultFunctions</code> for extraction; <code>Catalog</code> with <code>Add</code>, <code>WritePOT</code> and <code>WritePOTFile</code>, <code>Message</code>, <code>Texts</code>, <code>Header</code> and <code>Warning</code> for the POT file; and <code>Check</code> with <code>Report</code> for the completeness check. See <a href="{{ basePath }}/extract" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/extract" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">the extract package</a>.</p>
<h2>Localizer contract</h2>
<pre><code>type Localizer interface { GetLocale() string }</code></pre>
<h2>Errors and missing keys</h2>
<p>Catalogue operations return <code>ErrorLanguageNotFound</code> or <code>ErrorLanguageAlreadyExists</code> where applicable, and merging returns <code>ErrorInvalidCatalogue</code> for a catalogue that does not fit. When a catalogue file cannot be read, <code>SetLanguage</code>, <code>SetLanguageFS</code> and <code>LoadLanguages</code> return an error that wraps both <code>ErrorLanguageNotFound</code> and the cause; compare with <code>errors.Is</code>. Lookups return strings with missing-key markers rather than an error (see <code>SetUntranslated</code>); the <code>Lookup</code> functions also report whether a translation was found. <code>AddLanguage</code> is deprecated in favor of <code>SetLanguage</code>.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/donseba/go-translator/tree/v2.0.0">Browse the v2.0.0 source</a> for the exact signatures and generated language headers.</p>
</article>
